# Optional licence key material for the bootkit (build.sh reads this file
# when it is present; it is gitignored, copy it to keys.env and fill it in).
#
# The values are hex; the public key is the 32-byte Curve25519 x-coordinate,
# the private key the 32-byte scalar, both little-endian.  When a value is
# not set here, the defaults baked into bootkit/keygen.c and
# bootkit/preload.c are used.
#
# CUSTOM_LICENSE_PUBLIC_KEY=<64 hex digits>
# CUSTOM_LICENSE_PRIVATE_KEY=<64 hex digits>
# MIKRO_LICENSE_PUBLIC_KEY=<64 hex digits, the stock RouterOS licence key>
